  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "#### 🆕 Additions\n- Added sealed `ArgumentsSpec` configuration seam\n- Added sealed `EnvironmentVariablesSpec` configuration seam\n- Added sealed `ProcessResourcePolicySpec` configuration seam\n- Added sealed `UserCredentialSpec` configuration seam with `IDisposable`\n- Split `SetWorkingSet` into independent `SetMinWorkingSet` and `SetMaxWorkingSet`\n\n#### ⚙️ Modifications\n- Changed `IProcessConfigurationBuilder` ConfigureXxx signatures to accept `Action<XxxSpec>`\n- Rewired `ProcessConfigurationBuilder` to hold and reuse shared spec instances\n- Deleted sub-builder interfaces and classes\n- Flowed environment variables and credentials through the `IProcessConfigurationBuilder` seam\n- Preserved argument escaping in `ProcessConfigurationFactory.Create`\n- Dropped unused `escapeArguments` param from `SetArguments(string)` overload\n- Relaxed `ProcessorAffinity` upper bound to accept valid bitmasks\n- Used correct bitmask upper bound for processor affinity\n- Snapshotted environment variables on `Build` to avoid aliasing\n- Copied `SecureString` on `SetPassword`/`Build` so disposing the spec does not invalidate the built credential\n- Improved error message when middleware type is not registered in DI\n\n#### 🐛 Bug Fixes\n- Fixed issues in `ProcessResultHelperExtensions`, `ConditionalMiddleware`, `ProcessMiddlewareBuilder`, `ProcessConfiguration`, and `RunnerConfigurationFactory`",
